      <definition>[= uliγtu] adj. Irksome, troublesome; complex, complicated, intricate.</definition>
      <page>873</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠣᠯᠢᠬᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠡᠷᠡᠭ</unicode>
